  {
    "id": "235300",
    "original": "３人のうちの１人が芝刈り機で私の庭を大雑把にさっと刈り、もう一人が妻の庭の端の伸びた雑草をさっと２、３回刈り、残りの一人はトラックに上がってタバコをすっていた。",
    "en": [
      {
        "id": "72678",
        "text": "While one of them sped around major parts of the property on the mower, a second made a few sweeps at some tall weeds on the edge of my wife's garden, and the third got into the truck and smoked a cigarette."
